{"summary":"This great learning puzzle game will let you develop your logic and math skills!","description":"Push your math skills over the limits. Online mode helps to increase your reaction time and ignites the spirit of challenge. Enjoy a fun way to learn and train your brain! \n\nExercise your mind with a new free game Numbers Logic Puzzle. This brainteaser is a mixture of lines and sudoku games with simple rules. \n\nFeatures:\n- 40 challenging levels \n- Gripping gameplay \n- Good mind trainer\n- Stylish colorful graphics\n- Multiplayer mode\n- Multilingual interface \n\nPlace digits next to each other so that their sum makes up 10. The number can be collected vertically or horizontally. If the sum is correct the digits disappear and you unlock the field tiles. Complete the said number by swapping the digits and change tiles color to white. All you need playing Numbers Logic Puzzle is simple math skills. Try a a lot of free levels to enjoy addictive gameplay!\n\n<b>Facebook:</b> <a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Ffacebook.com%2FAbsolutist.games&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0rW5DE562qoxjxwX_gPXqS\">http://facebook.com/Absolutist.games</a>\n<b>Website:</b> <a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fabsolutist.ru&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw2BtPSBnvnrnU-yphPCbncL\">http://absolutist.ru</a>\n<b>YouTube:</b> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTPgyXadAX_dT4smCrEKqBA\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTPgyXadAX_dT4smCrEKqBA</a>\n<b>Instagram:</b> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fabsolutistgames&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw34HVooRRkhp98x9v0plGSJ\">https://www.instagram.com/absolutistgames</a>\n<b>Twitter:</b> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fabsolutistgame&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw3WcJ0LysnQ3g4lLaTaW9D2\">https://twitter.com/absolutistgame</a>\n\nQuestions? Contact our <b>tech support</b> at support@absolutist.com","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$2.99 per item","video